{"url": "https://www.scottohara.me/code/", "silo": "aria", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en-us\" class=\"js wf-opensans-n4-active wf-opensans-n6-active wf-opensans-i4-active wf-opensans-i6-active wf-active\"><head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <title>Code Abode | scottohara.me</title>\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover\">\n  <script src=\"https://ajax.googleapis.com/ajax/libs/webfont/1/webfont.js\" async=\"\"></script><script>document.documentElement.className = document.documentElement.className.replace('no-js', 'js');</script>\n\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Scott O'Hara is a designer and developer based outside of Boston MA. He writes code and cares a ton about building great, accessible user experiences for everyone.\n\">\n  <meta name=\"twitter:dnt\" content=\"on\">\n\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/css/main.css\">\n  <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.scottohara.me/code/\">\n  <link rel=\"alternate\" type=\"application/rss+xml\" title=\"Scott O'Hara - Accessibility engineer, UX developer and designer\" href=\"https://www.scottohara.me/feed.xml\">\n\n  <script>\n    WebFontConfig = {\n      google: { families: [ 'Open+Sans:400,400italic,600,600italic:latin' ] }\n    };\n    (function() {\n      var wf = document.createElement('script');\n      wf.src = ('https:' == document.location.protocol ? 'https' : 'http') +\n      '://ajax.googleapis.com/ajax/libs/webfont/1/webfont.js';\n      wf.async = 'true';\n      var s = document.getElementsByTagName('script')[0];\n      s.parentNode.insertBefore(wf, s);\n    })();\n  </script>\n  <noscript>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Open+Sans:400italic,600italic,400,600\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  </noscript>\n\n  <link href=\"/manifest.json\" rel=\"manifest\">\n  <link rel=\"shortcut icon\" type=\"image/ico\" href=\"/assets/img/favicon.ico\">\n  <link rel=\"apple-touch-icon-precomposed\" href=\"/assets/img/apple-icon-144.png\">\n  <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#0a669f\">\n  <link rel=\"author\" type=\"text/plain\" href=\"/humans.txt\">\n  <link rel=\"webmention\" href=\"https://webmention.io/www.scottohara.me/webmention\">\n  <link rel=\"pingback\" href=\"https://webmention.io/www.scottohara.me/xmlrpc\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Open+Sans:400,400italic,600,600italic&amp;subset=latin\" media=\"all\">\n</head>\n\n  <body id=\"body\" class=\"code\">\n    <div class=\"page\">\n      <header id=\"page_banner\" class=\"page__banner\">\n  <div class=\"jump-home\">\n    <a href=\"#content_heading\" class=\"jump-link\">\n      Jump to main <span role=\"presentation\">content</span>\n    </a>\n\n    <p class=\"page__banner__home\">\n      <a href=\"/\">\n        <span class=\"avatar\">\n          <img src=\"/assets/img/scott.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n        </span>\n        <span class=\"name\">scottohara.me</span>\n      </a>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n  <nav id=\"nav_wrap\" class=\"page__banner__nav\">\n    <ul class=\"page__banner__nav__list\" id=\"site_nav\">\n      \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n      \n        \n        <li class=\"page__banner__nav__list__item\">\n          <a href=\"/writing/\">\n            Writings\n          </a>\n        </li>\n        \n      \n        \n        <li class=\"page__banner__nav__list__item\">\n          <a href=\"/code/\" aria-current=\"page\">\n            Code\n          </a>\n        </li>\n        \n      \n        \n        <li class=\"page__banner__nav__list__item\">\n          <a href=\"/talking/\">\n            Talks\n          </a>\n        </li>\n        \n      \n    </ul>\n  </nav>\n</header>\n\n      <div class=\"page__main-foot\">\n        <main>\n          <div class=\"post\">\n  <div class=\"topic-header page-header\">\n    <div class=\"content-area\">\n      <h1 id=\"content_heading\" class=\"post__header__title\">\n        Code Abode\n      </h1>\n    </div>\n  </div> <!-- .page-header -->\n\n  <div class=\"tri\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n  <div class=\"content-wrap\">\n    <div class=\"content-area\">\n      <p>I’ve written some code, and I’ve done my very best to make sure it doesn’t stink. You can find a whole bunch of said code on my <a href=\"https://github.com/scottaohara\">GitHub</a> or <a href=\"https://codepen.io/scottohara\">CodePen</a> profiles.</p>\n\n<p>Feel free to file an issue, or make a PR if you find that my code has an odor, despite my best efforts.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"but-looking-through-all-your-content-sounds-hard\">But, looking through all your content sounds hard…</h2>\n\n<p>That’s fair. Doing things is harder than not doing things, after all. I can’t expect you to go through <em>all</em> my stuff. So here are a just a few things to poke at:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://github.com/scottaohara/accessible-components\">Accessible Components</a><br>\nAccessible markup patterns and progressively enhanced JavaScript components to build common UI patterns. <small>(this is kinda cheating because there’s a lot of individual repos linked in here, such as <a href=\"https://github.com/scottaohara/a11y_accordions\">accordions</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/scottaohara/accessible_modal_window\">modal dialogs</a> and more…)</small></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://github.com/scottaohara/a11y_styled_form_controls\">The Accessibility of Styled Form Controls</a><br>\nA deep dive into ways to style or seemingly style form controls and related elements. Includes markup patterns, CSS, JavaScript when applicable, and documentation for screen reader support at the time the patterns were created.</p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 id=\"sorta-code\">Sorta code</h2>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://github.com/scottaohara/accessibility_interview_questions\">Accessibility Interview Questions</a> <br>\nA whole bunch of accessibility and inclusive design related questions to ask an interviewee. I’ve been told people actually use these.  Neat! <a href=\"https://github.com/scottaohara/accessibility_interview_questions/issues/new\">Question submissions are welcome</a>!</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/html-aria/\">W3C ARIA in HTML specification</a><br>\nJoined as editor in September 2019.</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/html-aam-1.0/\">W3C HTML AAM specification</a><br>\nJoined as editor in July 2018.</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/aria/\">W3C WAI-ARIA specification</a><br>\nJoined as working group participant in mid-2019.</p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n          <div class=\"txt-right\">\n            <a href=\"#page_banner\" class=\"back-to-top\">Back to top</a>\n          </div>\n        </main>\n        <footer id=\"page_footer\" class=\"page__footer\">\n  <ul class=\"list-clean list-horizontal has-pipes\">\n    <li>\n      <a href=\"/about\">About Me</a>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/scottaohara\" rel=\"me\" aria-label=\" GitHub: scottaohara\">\n  <span class=\"icon icon--github\">\n    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><path fill=\"#828282\" d=\"M7.999,0.431c-4.285,0-7.76,3.474-7.76,7.761 c0,3.428,2.223,6.337,5.307,7.363c0.388,0.071,0.53-0.168,0.53-0.374c0-0.184-0.007-0.672-0.01-1.32 c-2.159,0.469-2.614-1.04-2.614-1.04c-0.353-0.896-0.862-1.135-0.862-1.135c-0.705-0.481,0.053-0.472,0.053-0.472 c0.779,0.055,1.189,0.8,1.189,0.8c0.692,1.186,1.816,0.843,2.258,0.645c0.071-0.502,0.271-0.843,0.493-1.037 C4.86,11.425,3.049,10.76,3.049,7.786c0-0.847,0.302-1.54,0.799-2.082C3.768,5.507,3.501,4.718,3.924,3.65 c0,0,0.652-0.209,2.134,0.796C6.677,4.273,7.34,4.187,8,4.184c0.659,0.003,1.323,0.089,1.943,0.261 c1.482-1.004,2.132-0.796,2.132-0.796c0.423,1.068,0.157,1.857,0.077,2.054c0.497,0.542,0.798,1.235,0.798,2.082 c0,2.981-1.814,3.637-3.543,3.829c0.279,0.24,0.527,0.713,0.527,1.437c0,1.037-0.01,1.874-0.01,2.129 c0,0.208,0.14,0.449,0.534,0.373c3.081-1.028,5.302-3.935,5.302-7.362C15.76,3.906,12.285,0.431,7.999,0.431z\"></path></svg>\n\n  </span>\n</a>\n\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/scottohara.me\">BlueSky: @scottohara.me</a>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <a href=\"/feed.xml\">RSS Feed</a>\n    </li>\n  </ul> <!-- /.list-horizontal -->\n\n  <p class=\"mt-8\">No large language models (LLMs) were used to create the content of this website.</p>\n\n  <p class=\"mt-8\">© Scott O'Hara, 2013 - 2025</p>\n  <script src=\"/js/jump.js\"></script>\n</footer>\n\n      </div>\n    </div> <!-- /.page -->\n  \n\n</body></html>", "links": [{"href": "https://www.scottohara.me/code/", "text": "Jump to main content", "title": "", "base_domain": "scottohara.me", "head_data": null, "head_extraction_status": null, "head_extraction_error": null, "intrinsic_score": 0.0, "contextual_score": null, "total_score": null}, {"href": "https://www.scottohara.me/", "text": "scottohara.me", "title": "", "base_domain": "scottohara.me", "head_data": null, "head_extraction_status": null, "h